sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Unity Update()
    participant GM as GameManager
    participant Sim as Simulation
    participant P as PowerSystem
    participant M as MachineSystem
    participant L as LogisticsSystem
    participant E as EnemySystem

    U->>GM: Update() each frame
    GM->>GM: _accumulator += deltaTime
    loop while accumulator >= 1/20 s
        GM->>Sim: Update()
        Sim->>Sim: Tick++
        Sim->>P: Tick(0.05s) — set OperatingRate on consumers
        Sim->>M: Tick() — advance CycleProgress at throttled rate
        Sim->>L: Tick(0.05s) — shift belt items, pull/deliver
        Sim->>E: Tick(0.05s) — enemy AI (placeholder)
        GM->>GM: accumulator -= 1/20 s
    end
    Note over GM,E: View MonoBehaviours read sim state in their own Update/LateUpdate
